00:18:36.940 --> 00:18:38.640
Just shut up!

00:18:43.190 --> 00:18:46.060
B-But what'll I do?

00:18:46.060 --> 00:18:48.620
He saw it!

00:18:49.520 --> 00:18:54.020
You could just say your mom makes you wear it.

00:18:54.020 --> 00:18:55.600
What mom would do that?!

00:18:57.310 --> 00:18:59.540
Anyways, I've had it.

00:19:00.240 --> 00:19:03.210
I'm sick of this thing controlling my life.

00:19:03.210 --> 00:19:05.660
And I'm sick of putting up with your baggage!

00:19:10.090 --> 00:19:11.070
But...

00:19:12.140 --> 00:19:15.170
But... there was no other way.

00:19:16.030 --> 00:19:17.370
I never wanted...

00:19:21.050 --> 00:19:22.390
Mitsuki?

00:19:23.210 --> 00:19:25.350
Hey, what happened to you?

00:19:25.350 --> 00:19:27.130
Hey, speak to me!

00:19:29.230 --> 00:19:31.770
What is this? The color's all murky!

00:19:34.180 --> 00:19:35.210
It's hot!

00:19:35.210 --> 00:19:36.840
Has she...?

00:19:36.840 --> 00:19:39.180
Mitsuki? Mitsuki!

00:19:39.180 --> 00:19:41.950
Mitsuki, answer me! Come back to me!

00:19:49.790 --> 00:19:53.460
I guess it wouldn't hurt to talk to her about it.

00:19:57.000 --> 00:19:59.820
Mitsuki! How are you feeling?

00:19:59.820 --> 00:20:01.800
I made some porridge. Do you want some?

00:20:06.180 --> 00:20:08.430
Wh-What was that?

00:20:13.000 --> 00:20:17.340
W-<i>Wait. Is Mitsuki doing what I think she's...</i>

00:20:21.110 --> 00:20:24.870
N-<i>No, what are you doing listening in on her?</i>

00:20:26.320 --> 00:20:27.530
Help me...

00:20:28.840 --> 00:20:32.370
Help... I can't breathe...

00:20:32.370 --> 00:20:33.830
Mitsuki!

00:20:33.830 --> 00:20:34.830
What's wrong?

00:20:34.830 --> 00:20:36.170
You all right?

00:20:46.550 --> 00:20:47.820
Oh God...

00:20:51.930 --> 00:20:55.900
Did I... come in at a bad time?

00:20:57.360 --> 00:21:01.280
What am I, stupid? This is no time to be weirded out!

00:21:01.280 --> 00:21:03.020
Mitsuki!

00:21:03.020 --> 00:21:06.390
Whoa! You're literally burning up!

00:21:06.390 --> 00:21:09.410
You need to sleep in your... bed.

00:21:10.870 --> 00:21:13.210
Those freaky panties!

00:21:14.490 --> 00:21:16.540
Onii-chan...

00:21:16.910 --> 00:21:18.500
Hey, wait...

00:21:18.500 --> 00:21:20.960
Mitsuki... don't!

00:21:35.330 --> 00:21:37.980
Yuuya... onii-chan...

00:21:39.110 --> 00:21:41.980
Let's... you and I...

00:21:42.920 --> 00:21:44.490
make love.

00:21:44.800 --> 00:21:45.570
Wh...

00:21:45.990 --> 00:21:48.020
Who are you?!

00:21:51.080 --> 00:21:53.810
Please hug me tight.

00:21:53.810 --> 00:21:56.410
The man of my dreams with the charming do.

00:21:56.410 --> 00:21:59.290
Come closer to me.

00:21:59.290 --> 00:22:02.170
Let’s make things more exciting.

00:22:13.270 --> 00:22:15.490
I want you to notice

00:22:15.490 --> 00:22:18.730
how much I feel like flailing about.

00:22:18.730 --> 00:22:21.030
I’ll gather up whatever courage I have

00:22:21.030 --> 00:22:24.190
and go full throttle towards you.

00:22:24.190 --> 00:22:26.560
Whenever a girl gets serious,

00:22:26.560 --> 00:22:29.780
you can’t imagine how far she’ll go.

00:22:29.780 --> 00:22:32.040
Raise the readings of my heart-shaped gauge

00:22:32.040 --> 00:22:35.120
and take me beyond the clouds.

00:22:35.120 --> 00:22:37.750
These ordinary days

00:22:37.750 --> 00:22:40.630
are something special to me.

00:22:40.630 --> 00:22:46.130
They’re like miracles covered in light.

00:22:46.130 --> 00:22:51.850
If I don’t act now, my feelings will stay bottled up.

00:22:51.850 --> 00:22:57.270
It's painful regretting what could have been.

00:22:57.270 --> 00:22:59.980
You’re my man with the charming do

00:22:59.980 --> 00:23:02.760
who makes my heart throb like no one else.

00:23:02.760 --> 00:23:05.470
Well you see, that’s because

00:23:05.470 --> 00:23:08.490
I love you very much.

00:23:08.490 --> 00:23:11.030
You make my heart race whenever I’m with you.

00:23:11.030 --> 00:23:13.700
But your charming do makes me stronger.

00:23:13.700 --> 00:23:16.570
I want to keep on loving you

00:23:16.570 --> 00:23:19.200
always and forever more.

00:23:20.410 --> 00:23:23.960
Next time on <i>Recently,
My Sister Is Unusual:</i>

00:23:23.960 --> 00:23:26.710
You are to wear
this at all times!

00:23:26.710 --> 00:23:28.340
What were <i>you</i> doing?!

00:23:28.340 --> 00:23:32.430
She's going to give up before
I reach Heaven's gate.

00:23:32.430 --> 00:23:34.890
It makes it too
embarrassing to talk.

00:23:35.450 --> 00:23:38.290
What does she want
to talk about?
